<title>BRAZIL: Brazil to announce June tax receipts.</title>
<headline>Brazil to announce June tax receipts.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Internal Revenue Service will announce tax receipts for June at 1530 local/1830 GMT, a spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>In May, federal tax receipts amounted to 8.716 billion reais, up 7.42 percent from the same month last year.</p>
<p>((-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-3141193))</p>
